aye Hollitt","Kathleen Bailey","Natanya Ross","Buckley Norris","Dana Sparks","Beatrice Colen","Maurice McRae","Betsy Lynn George","Paul Raci","Charles Kahlenberg","Lisa Stahl","Merrick Deamon","Christopher Pennock","Greg Stone","John Forker","Doc Duhame","Aaron Lohr","Michael Stoyanov","Shawn David Thompson","Griffin Drew","Ray Girardin","Jan Rabson","Richard Danielson","Nick Paulos","Sebastian Siegel","Micah Grant","Tabby Hanson","Marjorie DeHey","Rod Arrants","Patrick Thomas O'Brien","Dan Blom","Matt Kaminsky","Maura Peters","Dwayne Barnes","Dean Tarrolly","Rodrigo Botero","Katherine Olsen","Richard Stay","Kathy Trageser","Phillip Van Dyke","Scott Allan Campbell","Carlo Corazon","Michele Harrell","Terri Hanauer","Ray Bumatai","Michael Cade","Dana Daurey","Peggy McIntaggart","Nicholas Shaffer","Malachi Pearson","William Hubbard Knight","David Marks","Matt Jardine","Judy Nazemetz","Hayley Carr","R.J. Williams","Adam Rich","Annette McCarthy","Kari Whitman","Heather Campbell","Tom Ohmer","Veronica Martell","Wayne Federman","Willie Gault","Michael Kagan","Jomarie Ward","John Crane","Lisa Canning","Danny Comden","Antoinette Byron","Michael Rothhaar","Andrea F. Friedman","Ron Evans","Damion","Karin Taylor","Bobby Wynn","Susanne Reed","Marvin C. Jones","Brandi Andres","Oliver Theess","Howard Shefman","Heidi Mark","Robert Gavin","Matt Westmore","Ismael 'East' Carlo","Heather Ngyuen","Reed Rudy","Frank Annese","Dave Keffer","Justus-Berumen Sandy","Anthony Guidera"],"screenwriters":["Douglas Schwartz","Gregory J. Bonann","Michael Berk","Chad Hayes","Carey W. Hayes","Rick Husky","Gillian Horvath","Peter Kiwitt","Max Strom","John Whelpley","Ronni Kern","Glenn A. Bruce","Maria Jacquemetton","Maurice Hurley","Michael Sloan","Eric Blakeney","Evan Somers","Frederick Rappaport","Kristy Dobkin","John Allen Nelson","I.C. Rapoport","Kim Weiskopf","Ernie Wallengren","Jill Donner","Terry Erwin","William Rabkin","Lee Goldberg","William A. Schwartz","Alan Swyer","Gary Capo","Julian Whatley","David Braff","Deborah Schwartz","W. Reed Moran","Lloyd J. Schwartz","Daniel Peterson","David Trim","Rolf Wallengren","Kate Boutilier","Gregg Segal","Michele Berk","Trish Garland","Steven Barnes","Sherri Ziff","Garner Simmons","Elroy Schwartz","Susan Hamilton Brin","Kimmer Ringwald","Reuben Leder","Tanquil Lisa Collins","Grant Rosenberg","Kevin L. Beggs","Maggie Marshall","Donald R. Boyle","Frank South","André Jacquemetton","Howard Grigsby","Calvin Clements Jr.","Claire Whitaker"],"cinematographers":["Gary Capo","John McPherson","James Pergola","Stuart Asbjornsen","Edward Morey III"],"composers":["Arthur B. Rubinstein","John D'Andrea","Cory Lerios","Larry Brown","Tom Harriman","George Gabriel","Tim McCauley","Bobby Martin"],"reviews":[{"author":"venca163","text":"Hodnocení zde je tak nízký, zase jeden z typických seriálů devadesátých let. Takovýhle devadesátky prostě byly, tohle si diváci žádali a sledovali to s gustem a dneska nad tím kdekdo ohrnuje nos, protože z objektivního hlediska je kvalita slabá. A co? Já se ani nezlobim. Nejkrásnější Pamela Anderson, Yasmine Bleeth a Carmen Electra, všechny je miluju! (70%)(18.04.2012)","stars":4},{"author":"Aluska88","text":"Nezapomenutelná Pobřežní hlídka a pro spoustu diváků (tehdy ještě možná dětí:) rovněž první setkání s Davidem Hasselhoffem a ještě ne tolik plastickou Pamelou Anderson či Alexandrou Paul (v ní do dneška vidím tu krátkovlasou záchranářku, jak běží po pláži:) Prostě Mitch Buchannon, C.J. Parker, Stephanie, Cody a další. A jejich červené plavky a plováky:) A také ona nesmrtelná úvodní znělka. Nemá smysl psát slovo \"nostalgie\" do všech komentářů k seriálům z dob dětství a Supermaxu, stejně jako asi nemá smysl psát, že to množství seriálů, na něž vzpomínáme a ty zlaté časy se již nikdy nebudou opakovat.(28.12.2011)","stars":3},{"author":"C0r0ner","text":"Pobřežní lýtka jsou skvělou parodií na už skvělou parodii. Mitch Buchannon a jeho banda blbounů a silikonů je opravdu groteskní uskupení procházející obrovskou porcí dílů bez jakékoli snahy nabídnout divákovi cokoli jiného, než smích nad vlastní hloupostí. Ano, nasmál jsme se dost, ale to by se nejspíš u Drama/Akční/Dobrodružný stávat nemělo. 10%(13.07.2016)","stars":null}],"vods":[{"platform":"Oneplay","url":"https://www.oneplay.cz/porad/10843-pobrezni-hlidka"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/69418-pobrezni-hlidka/prehled/","root_id":69418,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":11,"episode_count":241,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null}